WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:00.810
AJA HAMMERLY:
Today I'll show you

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:03.120
how to get alerts on
changes to your system.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.870
I would like to get an email
any time someone creates a VM

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:07.460
instance in my project.

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:10.830
In StackDriver logging, select
GCE VM Instance, and then

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:12.420
select Activity.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:15.900
Now you can see all the audit
logs on my GCE resources.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.330
If I expand this one, I
see that the method name

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.390
is compute instances insert,
which is a VM create.

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:23.070
So I'm going to show
matching entries,

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.690
just to see my create logs.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:27.060
In order to get an alert,
I need to create a metric.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.560
I name my metric.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.300
And then I click Create Metric.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.460
Now I go to Stackdriver
monitoring and click

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:33.750
Create An Alert Policy.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.660
I add a condition using
a metric threshold.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.310
And my resource
type, in this case,

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:39.930
is going to be log metrics.

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:43.380
I can select my user-defined
metric here, set a threshold,

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:44.680
and then save the condition.

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:46.290
I said I wanted to
be notified, so I'm

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.270
going to set up an
email notification.

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:50.820
I could also use SMS,
a web hook or the app,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.740
or any of the other
notification methods

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:54.640
available in
StackDriver monitoring.

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:56.220
I'm going to name my policy.

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:57.990
And then I'll save the policy.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:02.060
Now if someone creates a VM
instance, I will get an email.

